{"family": "megaloc", "task": "retrieval", "name": "MegaLoc", "plain": "MegaLoc (Politecnico di Torino, 2025): one descriptor per photo to find photos of the same place (place recognition, loop closure, image pairs for 3-D reconstruction); DINOv2 ViT-B with optimal-transport pooling. MIT code and weights; some training sets are research-only.", "summary": "MegaLoc (Berton and Masone, CVPR 2025 workshops): one image-retrieval model for visual place recognition, landmark retrieval and structure-from-motion pair selection. A DINOv2 ViT-B/14 fine-tuned on a mix of place-recognition, landmark and SfM datasets; its patch features are assigned to 64 clusters by optimal transport (SALAD-style aggregation) and projected to an 8448-d unit descriptor.", "tier": "experimental", "upstream": "https://github.com/gmberton/MegaLoc", "upstream_commit": "5fe0dd697c4a70ba3e23607f6716ab3c606b16db", "original_is": null, "papers": [{"title": "MegaLoc: One Retrieval to Place Them All", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.17237", "date": "2025-02-24", "venue": "CVPRW 2025", "variants": []}], "official": [], "modes": ["portable", "kernels"], "portable_dtype": "float16", "kernels_dtype": "float16", "kernel_libs": ["fastbb", "dpt_fused"], "mps_kernel_libs": [], "mps_dtypes": ["float32"], "no_kernels_reason": "", "options": [], "outputs": [{"name": "descriptor", "extra": false}], "output_info": {}, "licence_files": ["LICENSE"], "licence_notes": [], "limitations": [], "task_io": "Input: one RGB image. Output: a global descriptor `[D]` (unit L2 norm) for image retrieval / visual place recognition; `fastforks.retrieval.top_k` and `pairs` find the nearest images (cosine similarity) on the GPU.", "install": {"extras": [], "noncommercial_weights": []}, "variants": [{"id": "megaloc", "released": null, "added_in": "0.2.0", "ref": "megaloc@1", "name": "megaloc", "setting": "", "default_tag": false, "params": {}, "licence": {"code": "MIT", "code_class": "permissive", "weights": "MIT", "weights_assumed": f